  "Question": "Given \\(\\triangle ABC\\cong\\triangle DEF\\) and \\(AB=5\\), what is the length of \\(DE\\)? (The vertices correspond as \\(A\\leftrightarrow D\\), \\(B\\leftrightarrow E\\), and \\(C\\leftrightarrow F\\).)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "5",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Corresponding sides of congruent triangles are equal. Since \\(AB\\) and \\(DE\\) are corresponding sides, \\(DE=AB=5\\).",
